# ::tok During the seminar , all the participants were guided by Xi Jinping 's new era socialist ideas , earnestly studied the spirit of the 20th Party Congress and Xi Jinping 's keynote address at the opening of the workshop , communicated and had in - depth discussions , deepened their understanding of a series of major theoretical and practical issues of China - style modernization , increased the confidence and determination to promote the Great Renaissance of the Chinese nation with Chinese - style modernization under the strong leadership of the Central Party with comrade Xi Jinping at the core , and strengthened their sense of duty , responsibility and mission to do good work and ensure a good start of the new era .
